[en.FOCUS_C12_LAND_EXPLORATION]
Land Exploration

[en.FOCUS_C12_LAND_EXPLORATION_desc]
There are still remote areas within our territory harboring significant mineral deposits. We can organize surveys and utilize them.

[en.FOCUS_C12_LAND_EXPLORATION_TOOLTIP]
Every subsequent §YMineral Exploration§! decision returns the political power spent immediately, and adds §Y2§! £resources_strip|5 upon completion.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_LAND_EXPLORATION]
土地勘探

[zh.FOCUS_C12_LAND_EXPLORATION_desc]
在我们领土里仍然有一些偏僻的地方蕴含着大量的矿藏，我们可以组织考察并加以运用

[zh.FOCUS_C12_LAND_EXPLORATION_TOOLTIP]
此后每一次进行§Y矿产资源勘探§!决议都会立即返还所消耗的政治点，并在完成时增加§Y2§!个£resources_strip|5。

